        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "15190b3f-7f21-3da5-bcc7-d84ededb059a",
                "word": "illégalité",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "537a77a6-9eb3-487d-9131-758e459fe295",
                        "entry_id": "15190b3f-7f21-3da5-bcc7-d84ededb059a",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "illégalités"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "15e5fd73-aacb-31db-8240-77de14b6fee1",
                        "entry_id": "15190b3f-7f21-3da5-bcc7-d84ededb059a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Caractère de ce qui est illégal."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b9489c50-f5e9-4b03-8119-12f8d0be2ad9",
                                "sense_id": "15e5fd73-aacb-31db-8240-77de14b6fee1",
                                "text": "Affolée, la jeune fille prit des adresses à la quatrième page des journaux et s’en fut chez des sages-femmes. On accepta bien de la débarrasser, mais les façons mystérieuses des personnes qui devaient se garantir, travaillant dans l’illégalité, lui causèrent de l’effroi. Elle venait de lire « Fécondité » de Zola, il y avait dans ce roman une histoire d’avortement avec hémorragie et mort qui la remplissait d’épouvante."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b9a0b9fa-0da1-4417-b33c-4032a41e4168",
                                "sense_id": "15e5fd73-aacb-31db-8240-77de14b6fee1",
                                "text": "L’illégalité d’une convention, d’une destitution."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c0e5f2f5-e6a8-30e1-a74b-17ca4782d113",
                        "entry_id": "15190b3f-7f21-3da5-bcc7-d84ededb059a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "État de ce qui est illégal."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c3a56e1f-1ce4-4399-8243-784dce41e02c",
                                "sense_id": "c0e5f2f5-e6a8-30e1-a74b-17ca4782d113",
                                "text": "Les changements à répétition des règles débouchent sur des imbroglios administratifs et juridiques inextricables et l’illégalité ouvre la porte à tous les trafics, mafias et répressions policières."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "910ba71a-b4e5-3bf8-a99d-4886a4a24073",
                        "entry_id": "15190b3f-7f21-3da5-bcc7-d84ededb059a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Acte illégal."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c8321732-44d1-4e78-b21b-a5e20037da73",
                                "sense_id": "910ba71a-b4e5-3bf8-a99d-4886a4a24073",
                                "text": "Commettre des illégalités."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a39dcae2-8b61-414d-94c8-de69a76e13be",
                        "source_entry_id": "15190b3f-7f21-3da5-bcc7-d84ededb059a",
                        "target_lang_word": "Illegalität",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Illegalität",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "56f73a5a-b29d-3d74-b5f2-48c82dce4387",
                                        "entry_id": "dfc3ee2f-acce-399f-b490-996cc2616b6b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "ohne Plural: Zustand der Ungesetzlichkeit, der mangelnden Rechtmäßigkeit"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "213912d8-f1b6-413d-ad46-44d4a6befb16",
                                                "sense_id": "56f73a5a-b29d-3d74-b5f2-48c82dce4387",
                                                "text": "„Es läuft ja sogar jetzt noch, sonst hätte ich diese Illegalität überhaupt nicht finanzieren können.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8d7a640d-a931-43cb-836c-98e3c5d43d14",
                                                "sense_id": "56f73a5a-b29d-3d74-b5f2-48c82dce4387",
                                                "text": "„Schon in der ersten Woche der Illegalität waren Cesar und Roman Bertini dabei, in völliger Dunkelheit, nur mit den Fingerkuppen Figuren und Partieverlauf abtastend, Schach zu spielen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a80d4a30-316d-39dc-b935-c575edf8a2f2",
                                        "entry_id": "dfc3ee2f-acce-399f-b490-996cc2616b6b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "einzelne nicht rechtmäßige Gegebenheit"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cbdd9a2d-a71d-471b-b731-8c041c16f52d",
                                                "sense_id": "a80d4a30-316d-39dc-b935-c575edf8a2f2",
                                                "text": "„Das Schweizer Recht und der bankrechtliche Kundendatenschutz dienen indes nicht dem Verdecken von Illegalitäten in irgendeinem Bereich.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "43da9aa5-387d-46c9-a05c-75b95eb9294d",
                        "source_entry_id": "15190b3f-7f21-3da5-bcc7-d84ededb059a",
                        "target_lang_word": "Gesetzwidrigkeit",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Gesetzwidrigkeit",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bf71de6f-cce0-37dd-aef6-5cdf138ae6cc",
                                        "entry_id": "055e0525-0880-3686-b2b0-f68d1cb4265a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "etwas, was gegen das Gesetz verstößt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5e197b52-1a71-4922-b618-b2c411c8c839",
                                                "sense_id": "bf71de6f-cce0-37dd-aef6-5cdf138ae6cc",
                                                "text": "„Von der Verwaltung für den Bürger erlassene allgemeine Regelungen (Rechtsverordnungen, Satzungen) sind bei Gesetzwidrigkeit nichtig, Einzelanordnungen (Verwaltungsakte) sind in der Regel anfechtbar.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "91652905-8b9e-4344-8a86-b63ea5bf288c",
                        "source_entry_id": "15190b3f-7f21-3da5-bcc7-d84ededb059a",
                        "target_lang_word": "illegality",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "illegality",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2d0d3f4d-9da9-301e-a8a3-4312e5abd30b",
                                        "entry_id": "f147c1e2-f322-391b-8aa6-a51a820244fd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "the state of being illegal"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bbe6fa48-6ba4-476c-a8c1-28a64dd1d4bd",
                                                "sense_id": "2d0d3f4d-9da9-301e-a8a3-4312e5abd30b",
                                                "text": "The criminal was aware of the illegality of his act."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "90ef6e3d-ad21-494e-8e14-87a4cb9341a9",
                                                "sense_id": "2d0d3f4d-9da9-301e-a8a3-4312e5abd30b",
                                                "text": "In Fraenkel’s defiance of mortality and professionalism and his skill in navigating the triple state lay part of the origins of his idea of the dual state. He answered the illegality in the Nazi prerogative state with his own commitment to illegality in both the resistance and even the legal system itself."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0e94a272-62a0-3c02-be60-e38ace86e2a7",
                                        "entry_id": "f147c1e2-f322-391b-8aa6-a51a820244fd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "a defense to the validity of a contract because it was in violation of the law"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9927725e-bc4a-4f33-98bb-95b51e20d7e7",
                                                "sense_id": "0e94a272-62a0-3c02-be60-e38ace86e2a7",
                                                "text": "When sued for refusing to pay for services provided by a prostitute, the customer raised the defense of illegality."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "98376ae4-e89c-47b4-8a18-99aebf4993e1",
                        "source_entry_id": "15190b3f-7f21-3da5-bcc7-d84ededb059a",
                        "target_lang_word": "lawlessness",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "lawlessness",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9a50679a-26e5-3904-8b14-e145b40be2a8",
                                        "entry_id": "db4fa502-7916-3860-ba13-59af6c486157",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A lack of law; a lack of law and order; anarchy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff906b81-dbf4-46ea-b0d5-1a472aa75b2d",
                                                "sense_id": "9a50679a-26e5-3904-8b14-e145b40be2a8",
                                                "text": "Near-synonyms: Wild West, free-for-all"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3d1da9c5-effa-378c-8aa6-bf129192a739",
                                        "entry_id": "db4fa502-7916-3860-ba13-59af6c486157",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Defiance of the law; outlawry, exorbitant levels of crime."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9e8ec11c-f4a4-4040-9bcc-a13d2c07b51f",
                                                "sense_id": "3d1da9c5-effa-378c-8aa6-bf129192a739",
                                                "text": "Houseless and Homeless. The estimate of the New York Housing Conference Secretary, Mr. Edward P. Doyle, that it will take half a billion dollars to overcome the present housing shortage, is probably not an exaggerated presentation of the plight New York is in in this respect. Furthermore, the housing-shortage conditions of New York reflect, proportionately, the conditions prevalent in almost every large city in the country. We seem to be threatened with widespread houselessness and homelessness, for the pitiable makeshifts to which so many are driven by house shortage, and the consequent exorbitant rents, are appalling travesties of what American homes should be. Just what Mr. Walter Stabler, Comptroller of the Metropolitan Life Insurance Company, meant when he said that \"unless radical action is taken something drastic will happen,\" is not quite clear. \"Something drastic\" is a pretty vague term. Mr. Stabler could hardly mean riotous invasions of the premises of the \"ins\" by infuriated mobs of the \"outs.\" Houselessness is undoubtedly a breeder of lawlessness, but it is not open to direct-action remedies of the bread riot variety which sheer hunger not infrequently precipitates. If people have not a place to lay their heads at night, not because they are penniless but because there are no roofs to shelter them, about the only thing they can do is to camp in parks and suburban fields. It has even come to that in Newark, and it may come to that elsewhere unless there is relief of some sort."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c2321fda-96b4-44d3-9d31-8353a7b783cd",
                                                "sense_id": "3d1da9c5-effa-378c-8aa6-bf129192a739",
                                                "text": "The Waterfront Commission of New York Harbor, created in the 1950s to break the mob’s grip on the docks, became its own bastion of corruption and lawlessnesses, according to a scathing report from the released on Tuesday after a nearly two-year investigation by the state inspector general’s office."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ce6156b6-f524-4f93-9aef-018b1c2973fa",
                                                "sense_id": "3d1da9c5-effa-378c-8aa6-bf129192a739",
                                                "text": "We’re in decline because a spirit of lawlessness, shamelessness and brainlessness has become a leading feature of a conservative movement that was supposed to be a bulwark against all three."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
